Run: `go test ./cmd/entire/cli/ -run 'TestControlPlaneDelete_Wiring|TestGrantRemove' -v`
Expected: FAIL — `✓ Deleted` not found (message currently has no ✓; note the message *does* appear in the `out` buffer under test because `SetOut` redirects `cmd.Printf` — the stderr bug only manifests in production, which is exactly why the explicit-writer fix matters).

- [ ] **Step 1.3: Fix the three production sites**

`corecmd.go` `runControlPlaneDelete` — replace both `cmd.Printf` calls:

```go
			if isCoreNotFound(err) {
